{
  "bodyHash": "8308889ea8fdd7c0",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Solar Flux Reborn 添加了可生成 FE 或 RF 的太阳板。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/246974_all.svg\" width=\"456\" height=\"18\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>核心模组提供 8 种不同等级的太阳板（完全可配置！）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>同时允许你创建具有自定义纹理、名称和 FE 产率的<span style=\"color:#800000\">自定义面板</span>！请阅读 /.minecraft/config/solarflux/custom_panels.js 或观看教程视频！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>请注意，本模组还整合了以下模组：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223565\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223565\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"32\">龙翼进化 (Draconic Evolution)</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223628\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223628\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;神秘时代 (Thaumcraft)</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261348\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261348\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;无尽贪婪 (Avaritia) </strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暮色森林 (The Twilight Forest)</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223794\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223794\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">应用能源2 (Applied Energistics 2)</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261061\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261061\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">黑洞存储 (Black Hole Storage) </strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/237664\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=237664\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">铁熔炉 (Iron Furnaces)</strong></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">1.14.4 版本不兼容 Java 11。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">1.16.5 版本不兼容 Java 17。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>模组内容：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>方块：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_1.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 I</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：1 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：8 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：25,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_2.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 II</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：8 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：64 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：125,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_3.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 III</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：32 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：256 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：425,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_4.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 IV</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：128 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：1,024 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：2,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_5.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 V</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：512 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：4,096 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：8,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_6.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 VI</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：2,048 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：16,384 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：32,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_7.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 VII</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：8,192 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：64,000 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：64,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_8.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 VIII</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：32,768 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：256,000 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：128,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223565\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223565\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"32\">龙翼进化 (Draconic Evolution)</a> 面板：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_de.wyvern.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;飞龙太阳能板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：65,536 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：512,000 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：256,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_de.draconic.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;巨龙太阳能板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：131,072 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：1,024,000 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：512,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_de.chaotic.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;混沌太阳能板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：524,288 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：4,096,000 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：2,048,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261061\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261061\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">黑洞存储 (Black Hole Storage)</a> 面板：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_dark_matter.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暗物质太阳能板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：65,536 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：512,000 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：256,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223628\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223628\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;神秘时代 (Thaumcraft)</a> 面板：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_alchemical.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;炼金太阳能板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：8 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：64 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：125,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_alchemical_brass.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;黄铜太阳能板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：32 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：256 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：425,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_thaumium.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;秘银太阳能板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：128 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：1,024 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：2,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_void_metal.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;虚空金属太阳能板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：512 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：4,096 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：8,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261348\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261348\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;无尽贪婪 (Avaritia)</a> 面板：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_avaritia.neutronium.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;中子素太阳能板（需安装无尽贪婪）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：8,388,608 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：32,768,000 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：131,072,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_avaritia.infinity.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;无限太阳能板（需安装无尽贪婪）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：16,777,216 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：65,536,000 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：262,144,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暮色森林 (The Twilight Forest)</a> 面板：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_tf.fiery.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 烈焰太阳能板（需安装暮色森林）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：2,048 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：16,384 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：32,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_tf.carminite.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 卡米尼特太阳能板（需安装暮色森林）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产率：8,192 FE/刻</li>\n<li>传输：65,536 FE/刻</li>\n<li>容量：64,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>物品：</strong></span></p>\n<p>材料：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/mirror.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;镜子</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_1.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;光伏电池 I</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_2.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 光伏电池 II</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_3.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 光伏电池 III</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_4.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 光伏电池 IV</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_5.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 光伏电池 V</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_6.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 光伏电池 VI</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/blazing_coating.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 烈焰涂层</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/emerald_glass.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 翡翠玻璃</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/ender_glass.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 末影玻璃</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_dark_matter.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暗物质光伏电池&nbsp;（如果安装了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261061\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261061\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 黑洞存储 (Black Hole Storage)</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/twilightforest_twilight_cell_1.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 暮光电池 I （如果安装了<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暮色森林 (The Twilight Forest)</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/twilightforest_twilight_cell_2.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 暮光电池 II （如果安装了<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暮色森林 (The Twilight Forest)</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/blank_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;空白升级模块</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>升级模块：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/efficiency_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;效率升级（最高20级，20级 = 2倍产率）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/transfer_rate_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;传输速率升级（最高10级，10级 = 2.5倍传输）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/capacity_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;容量升级（最高10级，10级 = 2倍容量）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/traversal_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;穿透升级（安装后，太阳能板将在5格范围内向连接的机器输出能量）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/dispersive_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;扩散升级（安装后，太阳能板将为附近的玩家充电）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/block_charging_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;方块充电升级（安装前，必须将其链接到它将发送能量的方块。安装后，太阳能板将在16格范围内向链接的方块输出能量）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/furnace_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;熔炉升级（安装后，为下方的熔炉提供燃料）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/twilightforest_twilight_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暮光升级&nbsp;（如果安装了<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暮色森林 (The Twilight Forest)</a>）（略微增加在暮色森林中收集的光照）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/ae2_energy_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;AEU 能源升级（如果安装了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223794\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223794\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 应用能源2 (Applied Energistics 2)</a>）（允许将太阳能板直接连接到 ME 网络。）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>部分特性：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>等级数量及其产率/容量可根据你的需求进行完全配置。</li>\n<li>相邻的太阳能板会自动共享能量，无需线缆。</li>\n<li>原版配方仅由原始模组的作者 <a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/_ForgeUser14240544\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/_ForgeUser14240544/avatar\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<strong>Nauktis</strong></a> 制作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><del>模组自带 3 种线缆：</del>（自 4.xxx 版本移除，不会在 SFR 中回归）</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><del><strong>基础线缆</strong> - 320 RF/刻</del></li>\n<li><del><strong>高级线缆</strong> - 3,200 RF/刻</del></li>\n<li><del><strong>终极线缆</strong> - 320,000 RF/刻</del></li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>线缆现已移至 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/303824\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=303824\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">Cable Flux</a></strong></span><strong>。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>SolarFluxReborn 是一个非常简单但同时又极具模块化特性的模组！</p>\n<p>我们制作了扩展 Solar Flux Reborn 可能性的东西：API。因此可以添加插件。</p>\n<p>已知且精彩的插件列表：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/294624\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=294624\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<strong>Wearable Solars</strong></a>&nbsp;- позволяет прикреплять любые солнечные панели к ЛЮБОМУ предмету шлема.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>Особая благодарность:</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/Ircmaan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/Ircmaan/avatar/40\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;Ircmaan</a>&nbsp;</strong>за идею и мотивацию.</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/_ForgeUser14240544\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/_ForgeUser14240544/avatar/40\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<strong>Nauktis</strong></a>&nbsp;за создание оригинального <a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/223548\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223548\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<strong>Solar Flux</strong></a> для версии 1.7.10.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Видео:</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vx1cFFmID30?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JBMmQlKyfYQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WVr6-3E7lA8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Разрешения:</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Вы можете использовать этот мод в своих модпаках.</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#930\"><strong>Вам не разрешается повторно загружать этот мод на другие сайты без предоставления ссылки на загрузку с CurseForge и моего разрешения (<span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdccg.herokuapp.com%252fdiscord%252fcard%252f376091478142746625\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/icons/zeitheron.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;Zeitheron</a></span>&nbsp;в Discord)</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Вам не разрешается включать этот (или любой другой мод команды DragonForge) в свой собственный мод. Однако создание аддонов разрешено, но было бы неплохо предупредить об этом меня в личных сообщениях.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Примечание:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Единственная поддерживаемая версия Minecraft — последняя, для которой существует этот мод. НЕ СПРАШИВАЙТЕ О СНИЖЕНИИ ВЕРСИИ!</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fds.zeith.org%252fdev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/dev.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Хотите обсудить что-то? Нужна помощь с API?</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Присоединяйтесь к серверу Discord и следите за Zeitheron в <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252fZeithTwitter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">Twitter</a>!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Если вы хотите поддержать мою работу, вы можете стать патроном через <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/zeitheron\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;Patreon</a>.&nbsp;<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/pix.iemoji.com/twit33/0744.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"33\"></strong></p>",
